-- Every admitted fold has a running form, and every scan is the same left recurrence held prefix by prefix: the numeric Greater/Lesser scans and their max/min bridges are one descriptor, the mean emits a prefix of its own state, and #\ counts admitted rows rather than physical slots.
-- An empty scope's scan is an empty column; #\ over an all-false mask is a column of zeros, because the scope is nonempty while the count never advances.
--! registry ../registries/030-scans.reg

--! out 3 4 12 16 25
+\ Weight @ Route

--! out 3 2 -6 -10 -19
-\ Weight @ Route

--! out 3 3 8 8 9
|\ Weight @ Route

--! out 3 3 8 8 9
max\ Weight @ Route

--! out 3 1 1 1 1
&\ Weight @ Route

--! out 3 1 1 1 1
min\ Weight @ Route

--! out 3 2 4 4 5
avg\ Weight @ Route

--! out 1 1 2 3 3 3 4 4
#\ Mixed

--! out
+\ Weight @ Gone

--! out 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
#\ Gone
